# Only relevant when EAS uploads the repository root. The mobile build runs
# from mobile-app/, which has its own .easignore.
#
# The previous version of this file was written with escaped wildcards
# (\*\*/node_modules/, _.md, _.png) plus a trailing EOF line, so it matched
# almost nothing and every build uploaded node_modules for the whole monorepo.
#
# Do not ignore *.png globally: mobile-app/assets/*.png contains the app icon,
# splash image and logo.

# Dependencies everywhere (each package installs them on the build server)
**/node_modules/

# Version control and tool caches
.git/
**/.git/
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
.freebuff/

# Generated build output
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/.next/
**/build/
**/android/
**/ios/
**/.kotlin/

# Archives and compiled binaries
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Logs, env files, OS clutter
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.env
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Non-mobile sibling projects and local documentation
web-app/
blockchain/
docs/
